B.O_=s(["Bingwa reads M-PESA payment messages on the selling phone to know who paid what, and reads Safaricom's USSD replies to send bundles. Other messages are not stored.","It keeps customers' phone numbers and names from M-PESA so it can send bundles and receipts.","Your records stay on the phone. When you sign in, a copy of your phones' status and recent records is kept in Google Firebase so you can see them on the web portal and your other phones. Only your login can open it.","Bingwa does not sell your data, show ads or track you.","You can export your data, delete your account and cloud data in the app, or write to mathiasfridah2@gmail.com."],t.s)
